; todo.kurt
load logic, equality

show p
proof
    todo p
qed

show p ⇒ q
proof
    todo
qed
; the output will be something like: '  todo.kurt:6 todo'
; however, the `test_kurt_proofs.py` harness itself only checks the last output line,
; which is always just "Proof checked." regardless of any pending todos
